#. うーん、なんだか…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nnn..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝よりも…さらに体調が悪くなったような……
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I feel even worse than I did this morning..."
msgstr ""

#. ますます体が重いし…それに……
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "My body feels like lead, and..."
msgstr ""

#. 寒気…？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...now I'm getting chills."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ヤバい……風邪かも……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is bad. I think I might be getting sick...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 舞園さんが…ここで…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Right here is where Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの悪夢だけは…
#. いつまでたっても忘れられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's one nightmare I still can't forget, no matter\n"
"how much time passes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園生活は…いつまで続くんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long are we going to be stuck here, living out\n"
"this school life...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Chúng ta sẽ phải mắc kẹt ở đây, sống cuộc sống học\n"
"đường này cho đến bao giờ chứ...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>完全にダルい…鉄板なんかどうでもいい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm so tired. Don't even care about those metal\n"
"plates...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>完全にダルい…鉄板なんかどうでもいい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm so tired. Don't even care about those metal\n"
"plates...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がどうしたんだ…
#. それより、風邪薬はないのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't need a notepad. I need some cold and flu\n"
"medicine...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>掃除…よりも風邪をなんとかしないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Cleaning isn't gonna help get rid of whatever I\n"
"have...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In here is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんから預かった
#. サバイバルナイフをしまったんだっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the survival knife that Toko found.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have a little time. Maybe I should get some rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うぅ…本当にゴミ箱に吐きそうだ…
#. でも…ここで吐いたら大変な事に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Urgh... I don't feel so good. I think I might throw up\n"
"into this trash can...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
